error[E0451]: `f64` can't be a key: it is a float
  --> tests/programs/collections/maps_and_sets/float_key.la:2:12
  |
2 |     let s: Set<f64> = #{1.5};
  |            ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: floats compare with `==` but aren't `Key`: `NaN != NaN`, so a float key could never be found again; use an integer

